OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening but remaining partly cloudy.
OL,7,FThe cloud will thicken overnight with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of light rain for all
OL,9,Ffollowed by showers across the
OL,10,FPennines and Cheviot Hills. Wind
OL,11,Feasing although remaining breezy
OL,12,Facross the hills. Cooler than recent
OL,13,Fnights.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FPartly cloudy to start with
OL,16,Fshowers persisting across the high
OL,17,Fground to the west. Cloud thickening,
OL,18,Fwith rain moving in by late afternoon.
OL,19,FA fresh and gusty south-westerly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
