OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSpells
OL,6,Fof rain and showers on Wednesday and
OL,7,FFriday, with drier and more settled
OL,8,Fconditions on Thursday. Breezy at
OL,9,Ftimes though temperatures remain
OL,10,Faround or a little above average.
